WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.630
Let me get this straight:

2
00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:07.070
you remember every bad beat
since joining TLPT,

3
00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.530
but you still haven’t installed the app?

4
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:10.900
Don’t be a donkey!

5
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.150
Put the yellow chip on your phone.

6
00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.300
Scan the QR code to get started.

7
00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.250
Need help?

8
00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.570
The instructions page
walks you through it.

9
00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:19.930
Give The Commish your answer

10
00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.770
without making him chase you around,

11
00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.150
like you owe him money.

12
00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.000
It’s TLPT RSVP.

13
00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:27.350
No account needed.

14
00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:28.900
No tanking required.

15
00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.700
You’ve thought longer
about calling with seven-deuce.

16
00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:35.070
Install the app, and put the
yellow chip on your phone!
